  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Lumber_Axe/BH_LA_HEADER.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:36px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Lumber_Axe/BH_LA_ABOUT.png\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">此模組新增了一把名為「伐木斧」的新斧頭</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">這把斧頭砍伐木材的速度比附魔效率 V 的鑽石斧還快</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">擁有 1080 點耐久度</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">搭配急迫效果可瞬間採集木材</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">攻擊速度與傷害皆非常低</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">可升級為下界合金材質</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">同時在「畜牧家」類別中新增 2 項成就</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rWAf2Ia.png\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:36px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Lumber_Axe/BH_LA_FEATURES.png\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">1.使用 1 個鐵錠與 2 個紅石製作「伐木鐵」</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/08bbNuR.png\" width=\"569\" height=\"373\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">2.使用該鐵錠製作斧頭</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jovT2HK.png\" width=\"568\" height=\"316\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">3.升級為下界合金</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4QIsoVL.png\" width=\"566\" height=\"254\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Mutant_Wolf/BH_MW_SHOWCASE.png\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1kMcdesomtg?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\" style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\"></iframe></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fcursed\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Lumber_Axe/BH_LA_PROMO.png\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">點擊上方的圖片，選擇方案（建議至少 4GB），使用我的代碼 <strong>Cursed</strong>&nbsp;即可獲得首月 <strong>25%</strong>&nbsp;折扣，並與好友一同暢玩！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/ZUah6a8Dqf\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Lumber_Axe/BH_LA_DISCORD.png\"></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
